{"page":"FUT6","gene":"FUT6","accession":"P51993","protein":"4-galactosyl-N-acetylglucosaminide 3-alpha-L-fucosyltransferase FUT6","length":359,"events":["Alternative splicing"],"canonical":{"accession":"P51993-1","name":"1","synonyms":[],"notes":[{"topic":"Function","text":"Catalyzes the transfer of L-fucose, from a guanosine diphosphate-beta-L-fucose, to the N-acetyl glucosamine (GlcNAc) of a distal alpha2,3 sialylated lactosamine unit of a glycoprotein- or a glycolipid-linked sialopolylactosamines chain or of a distal or internal lactosamine unit of a neutral glycoprotein- or a glycolipid-linked polylactosamines chain through an alpha-1,3 glycosidic linkage and participates in surface expression of the sialyl Lewis X (sLe(x)), Lewis X (Le(x)) and non sialylated VIM2 determinants (PubMed:10728707, PubMed:1339443, PubMed:1520296, PubMed:17604274, PubMed:29593094, PubMed:7650030, PubMed:9363434, PubMed:9451035). Moreover transfers fucose to H-type 2 (Fucalpha1-2Galbeta1-4GlcNAc) chain acceptor substrates and participates in difucosylated sialyl Lewis x determinants (PubMed:1339443, PubMed:17604274). Also fucosylates a polylactosamine substrate having a 6 sulfate modification at the GlcNAc moiety and gives rise to sialyl and non-sialyl 6-sulfo lewis X (PubMed:10728707). Does not have activity towards type 1 ((Galbeta1-3GlcNAc)) and H-type 1 chain (Fucalpha1-2Galbeta1-3GlcNAc) acceptors substrates (PubMed:1339443, PubMed:17604274, PubMed:9363434)"}],"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000318336.10","ENST00000286955.5","ENST00000524754.1","ENST00000527106.5","ENST00000905019.1","ENST00000905020.1","ENST00000905021.1","ENST00000962499.1"],"refseq":["NM_000150.4","NM_001040701.2","NM_001369502.1","NM_001369504.1","NM_001369505.1","NM_001381955.1","NM_001381956.1"],"refseqProteins":["NP_000141.1","NP_001035791.1","NP_001356431.1","NP_001356433.1","NP_001356434.1","NP_001368884.1","NP_001368885.1"],"maneSelect":true,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"model":{"entry":"AF-P51993-F1